{"id":"53078","nombre":"Sopa de remolacha (borsch)","original":"Beetroot Soup (Borscht)","categoria":"Vegetarian","origen":"Ucrania","imagen":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/zadvgb1699012544.jpg","video":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6CXgPVw_-0g","enlace":"https://natashaskitchen.com/classic-russian-borscht-recipe/","etiquetas":["Sopa"],"ingredientes":[["Remolacha","3","Beetroot"],["Aceite de oliva","4 cdas","Olive Oil"],["Cubo de caldo de pollo","1","Chicken Stock Cube"],["Agua","6 tazas","Water"],["Papas","3","Potatoes"],["Porotos cannellini","1 lata","Cannellini Beans"],["Eneldo","Para decorar","Dill"]],"pasos":["Chop the beetroot, add water and stock cube and cook for 15mins. Add the other ingredients and boil until soft. Finally add the beans and cook for 5mins. Serve in the soup pot."],"pasosEnIngles":true}